  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "volcanic features",
    "es": "objetos volcánicos"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "Geomorphologic landscapes and landforms related to the deep seated (igneous) processes by which magma and associated gases rise through the crust and are extruded onto the earth's surface and into the atmosphere.",
    "es": "Paisajes geomorfológicos y formas del relieve relativos a procesos ígneos en virtud de los cuales magma y gases asociados atraviesan la corteza y son expulsados sobre la superficie terrestre y a la atmósfera."
  },
